```{mermaid}
flowchart LR
    Key["🔑 Symmetric Key"]
    
    Data1["Veri"] --> Encrypt["Şifrele"]
    Encrypt --> EncryptedData["Şifrelenmiş veri"]
    EncryptedData --> Decrypt["Deşifrele"]
    Decrypt --> Data2["Veri"]

    %% Shared junction point to mimic the single line branching down
    Key --> Fork(("Hem şifreleme hem deşifrelemede kullanılır"))
    Fork --> Encrypt
    Fork --> Decrypt

    classDef default fill:#fff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef keyStyle fill:#ffff99,stroke:#99cc00,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef encryptedStyle fill:#b3b3b3,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef forkStyle fill:none,stroke:none;

    class Key keyStyle;
    class EncryptedData encryptedStyle;
    class Fork forkStyle;
```
